# Local development, tests, and deployment helpers are intentionally
# excluded from the published Hermes plugin checkout. Hermes installs this
# repository directly into $HERMES_HOME/plugins/clawchat, so keep GitHub's
# tracked tree focused on runtime plugin files plus repository documentation.
.e2e/
# Ignored wholesale EXCEPT the named regression checks below. Those cover
# invariants that are invisible to a single-profile run (multiplex profile
# isolation), so they ship with the code instead of relying on `git add -f`.
tests/*
!tests/test_multiplex_isolation.py
deploy/
scripts/
docs/superpowers/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
